## contril statement
 -  in which to control the loop why because if i get anwer again it's looping until the sequence is compled.

    # break
    -stops the loop immediately.
     -------syntax------
      for variable in sequence:
          #block of code
          break

    # continue
    - it will the skip the present statement.
         -------syntax------
      for variable in sequence:
          #block of code
          continue

    # pass
    - its works as a place holder ,mean the condition is true but it can't give otput.

     -------syntax------
      for variable in sequence:
          pass

## else in loop
